A branch is:an independent line of development.

It allows developers to:

work safely
test features
experiment
fix bugs
collaborate

WITHOUT affecting the main project.

HEAD means:current active branch / current working position



Creating Branch:
    git branch GitNewBranch

-> This only CREATES branch.
-> It does NOT switch branch.

Branch Switching :
    git checkout GitNewBranch
    git switch GitNewBranch
    git checkout -b GitNewBranch
    git switch -c GitNewBranch